nup_server.sh for polling version (no port 8080)\n- Added deployment_guide_polling.md with detailed instructions\n- Clarified firewall settings for polling vs webhook\n- Emphasized security benefits of polling approach\n\nKey changes:\n- Port 8080 is NOT needed for polling version\n- Firewall blocks all incoming connections\n- Only outgoing connections to Telegram API allowed\n- Better security for interruptible servers", "created_at": "2025-08-29T19:09:44Z", "repo": "telegram-bot", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "075e2244792dd2bbe40fdece5a8870ab6d8ca500", "message": "Add polling version of the bot - ideal for interruptible servers\n\n- Added bot_polling.py - complete rewrite using polling instead of webhook\n- Added config_polling.py - simplified configuration for polling\n- Added start_bot_polling.sh - startup script for polling version\n- Added restart_bot_polling.sh - management script for polling version\n- Added auto_restart_polling.sh - auto-restart monitoring for polling\n- Added deploy_polling.sh - deployment script for polling version\n- Added env_example_polling.txt - environment variables for polling\n- Added README_polling.md - comprehensive documentation for polling\n\nPolling version advantages:\n- No public IP required\n- Works behind NAT and firewalls\n- Better for interruptible servers\n- Automatic recovery after interruptions\n- Simpler configuration (only bot token needed)", "created_at": "2025-08-29T18:20:57Z", "repo": "telegram-bot", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a357318f1767509587231dc83892897ee70a5fcb", "message": "Add server cleanup script for deployment preparation", "created_at": "2025-08-29T18:09:37Z", "repo": "telegram-bot", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "999eed5b02c65e55f282413d930e1122b716ca6e", "message": "Major improvements: Enhanced bot with auto-restart, monitoring, and deployment scripts\n\n- Added improved bot version with better error handling and logging\n- Implemented automatic restart functionality for interruptible servers\n- Added configuration management with environment variables\n- Created deployment and monitoring scripts\n- Added health check endpoints\n- Improved security by removing hardcoded tokens\n- Added comprehensive documentation and README\n- Created systemd service template for auto-startup", "created_at": "2025-08-29T17:56:51Z", "repo": "telegram-bot", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2d714b884f550efcfee970c0911592100e4fa100", "message": "Add files via upload", "created_at": "2025-06-30T17:19:58Z", "repo": "telegram-bot", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6b32f91d6f55c4867335b889b22f7ca4a61abb8e", "message": "\u0412\u0441\u0451 \u043e\u043a", "created_at": "2025-06-30T09:53:49Z", "repo": "telegram-bot", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "350f056aa564643075beb99a8957b45b6c1603b7", "message": "Add files via upload", "created_at": "2025-03-07T20:39:19Z", "repo": "telegram-bot", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0b49cd16fcac80747991decbfd12d2371a9160f9", "message": "Add system administration scripts and documentation: health check, service management, cron setup, systemd service setup, and updated README files", "created_at": "2025-08-29T16:50:21Z", "repo": "rent-use_AI", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "68a6a11d07dff7e3b5ad7345d9fab9a1ac4f328e", "message": "chore: prepare for server deploy\\n- remove ngrok and logs\\n- move READMEs to rent_use/docs\\n- add server_install.sh\\n- add root .gitignore\\n- wire dotenv for bot and backend", "created_at": "2025-08-29T09:24:27Z", "repo": "rent-use_AI", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ea06b8e611ae886b4de9e81fb1b7fe087695f